{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLITZCORE is a stylized 2D bullet hell where the world of magic turns into a whirlwind of chaos. You play as a mysterious mage in a purple cloak, challenging armies of fantastical creatures and massive bosses. Every encounter is a test of reflexes, precision, and the smart use of your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than 15 spells at your disposal, battles never play out the same. From rapid-fire magical attacks to defensive barriers, every choice matters. Over 10 unique enemies and more than 5 powerful bosses await, each with their own attack rhythm, patterns, and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLITZCORE strikes the perfect balance between challenge and fairness \u2014 every mistake is punished, but every victory feels like a true achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 15+ magical abilities to choose and combine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5+ unique bosses with distinct attack patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10+ enemy types with unique fighting styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cartoon-styled 2D visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging yet fair gameplay</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000230?t=1757378754","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000230?t=1757378754","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000230/23df1f2ad0066c5dcf40d9d904a64706aeb4960f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757378754","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000230/23df1f2ad0066c5dcf40d9d904a64706aeb4960f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757378754","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLITZCORE is a stylized 2D bullet 